        <p source="#source-833204-833312"><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-833204-833310"><graphic url="fig1704_08.png" width="704px" height="400px"/><note type="caption-reference"><seg source="#source-833213-833225">鍬取りて</seg></note></figure></p>
        <p source="#source-833312-833389"><seg type="caption" source="#source-833312-833387"><seg source="#source-833339-833351">鍬取りて</seg></seg></p>
